                <mxCell id="c36" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=fill;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Farmers&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Log in.&lt;br&gt;2. Click &lt;i&gt;Record delivery&lt;/i&gt; and enter the litres.&lt;br&gt;3. Note your batch number.&lt;br&gt;4. Check status; open the receipt once Paid.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Graders&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Open &lt;i&gt;Batches to test&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;2. Select a batch, enter measured litres.&lt;br&gt;3. Choose Pass or Reject and save.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Admin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Open &lt;i&gt;Approvals&lt;/i&gt;, review tested batches.&lt;br&gt;2. Approve payment; the farmer is emailed.&lt;br&gt;3. Use &lt;i&gt;Reports&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;Audit log&lt;/i&gt; from the menu." vertex="1">
